    "rich_text_h9CUhL": {
      "type": "mw-rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_Ckcjhc": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Meldwood started with a simple frustration: furniture shouldn't need 47 screws, an Allen wrench, and a lost Sunday afternoon to put together — and it definitely shouldn't fall apart the first time you move.</p><p>So we threw out the playbook. Every piece we make assembles in under two minutes with zero tools, uses real furniture-grade imported plywood instead of particleboard, and ships raw — so the final look is entirely yours. Furniture built on simplicity, strength, and timeless design, we still cut and pack every order ourselves from our small workshop in Pakistan.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
