      "type": "mw-image-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_Q7j98A": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Real <em>plywood</em>, not particle board.",
            "size": "large"
          }
        },
        "text_fDVLCz": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We use furniture-grade imported plywood  — the same material that goes into speaker cabinets, skate ramps, and museum exhibits. Cross-laminated veneers at alternating 90-degree angles. It doesn't warp. It doesn't sag. It holds joints better than anything else on the market.</p><p>You can sand it, stain it, paint it, or leave it raw. However you finish it, the bones are solid.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
