          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Two minutes. <em>Zero tools.</em> Every time.",
            "size": "large"
          }
        },
        "text_Kdtwbc": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our interlocking joint system means no screws, no cam locks, no Allen wrenches. Slide the pieces together and you're done. A kid can do it — and they do.</p><p>This isn't just about convenience. Tool-free assembly means you can take it apart just as easily. Moving across the country? Flat-pack it, ship it, rebuild it in two minutes. Your furniture survives as many moves as you do.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
